// 새 베이크와 저장된 지형에서 왕복 보행선의 물리 지지면을 R1 기준과 다시 비교한다.
var s=UnityEngine.SceneManagement.SceneManager.GetActiveScene();if(s.path!="Assets/01.Scenes/ArtReview/WorldThemes/ShadeCreekR2.unity"||s.isDirty||EditorApplication.isPlayingOrWillChangePlaymode)throw new Exception("저장된 R2 필요");
var d=Terrain.activeTerrain.terrainData;var baseline=AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<TerrainData>("Assets/10.Datas/World/ThemeStudies/ShadeCreekR1/Terrain.asset");var route=new[]{new Vector2(1700,740),new Vector2(1640,750),new Vector2(1605,805),new Vector2(1608,814),new Vector2(1650,855),new Vector2(1750,870)};int count=0;float max=0;var failures=new List<string>();
for(int i=0;i<route.Length-1;i++){var delta=route[i+1]-route[i];var side=new Vector2(-delta.y,delta.x).normalized;int steps=Mathf.CeilToInt(delta.magnitude);for(int j=0;j<=steps;j++)for(int offset=-4;offset<=4;offset++){var p=Vector2.Lerp(route[i],route[i+1],j/(float)steps)+side*offset;float change=Mathf.Abs(d.GetInterpolatedHeight(p.x/2400,(p.y+700)/2800)-baseline.GetInterpolatedHeight(p.x/2400,(p.y+700)/2800));count++;max=Mathf.Max(max,change);if(change>.02f)failures.Add(p+" delta="+change);}}
var result=new{samples=count,width=8,maxDelta=max,failures,scope="R1 대비 R2 보행 지지면 ±4m. 실제 TPS 통행 검증 아님"};var json=AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies().Select(a=>a.GetType("Newtonsoft.Json.JsonConvert")).First(t=>t!=null);System.IO.File.WriteAllText("output/ShadeCreekR2/walking-support.json",(string)json.GetMethod("SerializeObject",new[]{typeof(object)}).Invoke(null,new object[]{result}));return result;
